REQUIRES Driver/DriverMain/Incomp

D sim_lengthScaleMeters Length scale for the simulation in SI units (meter)
PARAMETER sim_lengthScaleMeters REAL 1.0

D sim_timeScaleSeconds Time scale for the simulation in SI units (seconds)
PARAMETER sim_timeScaleSeconds REAL 1.0

D sim_tempScaleExpr Expression to define the temperature scale (T_DELTA*T + T_BULK)
PARAMETER sim_tempScaleExpr STRING "T_DELTA*T + T_BULK"
